      "description": "Enap Refinerías S.A. has a storage capacity of 4,800 cubic meters, the Vinapu terminal ensures the supply of fuel to the island.\nOil comes from ships anchored off shore through of a 20.32 cm (8in) pipeline, 800 meters (2,625 ft) long. The oil is stored in 6 tanks, each holding 800 cubic meters (211,337.64 Gallons). \n\nThere is a truck loading system (pumping room and filling platform) and a fire-fighting system. The company hast a fleet of three tanker trucks and two semi-trailers.",
